# libdbus allocations on the xcb/NVIDIA platform path survive process teardown (GPU run 1).
# native-rules #15: leak suppression for a library leak on the project GPU run path
leak:libdbus-1.so
# NVIDIA VAAPI 0.0.18 leaks its surface-export list storage on its own resolveSurfaces thread.
# native-rules #15: leak suppressed in a VAAPI driver, hides leaks of project decoder teardown
leak:direct_realiseSurface
# NVIDIA VAAPI 0.0.18 leaks allocateObject's config-list storage after decoder teardown.
# native-rules #15: leak suppressed in a VAAPI driver, hides leaks of project decoder teardown
leak:nvCreateConfig
# NVIDIA VAAPI 0.0.18 leaks allocateObject's slice-buffer list storage after decoder teardown.
# native-rules #15: leak suppressed in a VAAPI driver, hides leaks of project decoder teardown
leak:nvCreateBuffer
# V-LEAK-2: injected unconfirmed fence waits deliberately retain Vulkan resources for process lifetime (B3).
# native-rules #15: suppresses a deliberate leak in a project test instead of freeing it
leak:TestVulkanInterop::teardownRequiresConfirmedFenceWait
# V-LEAK-2: injected unconfirmed acquire deliberately retains images/memory, checked by B3 destructionStats.
# native-rules #15: suppresses a deliberate leak in a project test instead of freeing it
leak:TestVulkanInterop::teardownRetainsUnreleasedImagesAfterUnconfirmedAcquire
# V-EXT-4: Qt Quick pixmap reader startup/jobs survive view teardown. Also matches project-triggered QML image-load leaks through TestTracksUi::load.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides project QML image-load leaks
leak:QQuickPixmap::load
# V-EXT-4: Qt SVG decoding storage held by reader jobs. Also hides SVG-plugin allocations retained by project image owners.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides SVG-plugin leaks of project image owners
leak:libqsvg.so
# V-EXT-4: Qt Quick reader texture factories survive teardown. Also hides factories leaked by project callers.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides texture factories leaked by project callers
leak:QQuickTextureFactory::textureFactoryForImage
# V-EXT-4: Qt pixmap reader's GLib dispatcher survives teardown. Also hides dispatcher leaks from project-owned Qt threads.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides dispatcher leaks of project Qt threads
leak:QEventDispatcherGlib::QEventDispatcherGlib
# V-EXT-4: Qt reader's deferred-delete event storage survives teardown. Also hides deferred-deletion event leaks from project QObject callers.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides deferred-delete leaks of project QObjects
leak:QObject::deleteLater
# V-EXT-4: Qt reader's 32-byte-per-loop QArrayData allocation under QEventLoop::exec survives teardown. Also hides leaks in project Qt worker event loops.
# native-rules #15: suppression also hides leaks in project worker event loops
leak:QThread::exec
# NVIDIA GL driver 610.57 internal allocations with no project frame survive process teardown (A document tests under the sanitize preset).
